Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: spi: apple: Add T7000 compatible

Document the T7000 controller compatible used by the iPhone 6 SPI bus.

Signed-off-by: Shayne Legault <8741557+shaynelegault@users.noreply.github.com>

---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@
           - const: apple,t8103-spi
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - apple,t7000-spi
               - apple,t8010-spi
               - apple,t8103-spi
               - apple,t8112-spi
